| 5 | **In-memory cache never expires** (line 9–10, `COMPANY_CACHE`) | Stock data fetched once is cached forever until server restart. Stale prices, ratios. | Add a TTL (e.g., 15 minutes) using `time.time()` checks, or use a simple `functools.lru_cache` with `maxsize`. |

