| 7 | **Sharpe ratio is hardcoded** (line 166): `1.25 if return > 0 else 0.45` | The signature metric of a backtest result is completely fake. | Compute from actual daily returns: `mean(daily_returns) / std(daily_returns) * sqrt(252)`. |
